{"5307290":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Devotheon","steam_appid":5307290,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVOTHEON<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gods have granted you their power. Now discover how far you can take it.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devotheon is a strategy roguelite inspired by Greek mythology, where every Odyssey begins with clear rules… and ends when you find a way to break them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the board, chain together powerful combos, and build ever-stronger strategies by combining <strong>spells, relics, and blessings<\/strong>. What starts as a simple choice can trigger a cascading reaction capable of completely transforming the battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras\/3fe0e53923adf1e1acfd6a6f90c7ab5c.avif?t=1793689579\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras_big\/3fe0e53923adf1e1acfd6a6f90c7ab5c.avif?t=1793689579 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE IMPOSSIBLE COMBINATIONS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Odyssey forces you to adapt to what you find.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effects, reshape the board, and uncover unexpected interactions between your abilities. The better your choices fit together, the further you can push each combo — and the more spectacular the chain reactions you can unleash.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW WAYS TO PLAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your options as you progress and discover new tools for building your strategies:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 unlockable deities<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>58 spells<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>85 relics<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>46 blessings<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new content, experiment with its interactions, and discover increasingly powerful combinations. Changing deities does not just mean changing characters — it means rethinking your strategy, prioritizing different synergies, and finding new ways to master the board.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras\/ab0187ad5aad76604315f7bf5bca2697.avif?t=1793689579\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras_big\/ab0187ad5aad76604315f7bf5bca2697.avif?t=1793689579 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CHALLENGE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devotheon features <strong>3 difficulty levels<\/strong>, allowing you to tailor the experience to your preferred style of play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the systems at your own pace, or push your strategies to the limit by taking on increasingly demanding challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras\/e04505f38b642d6c9fa150f23a79e708.avif?t=1793689579\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras_big\/e04505f38b642d6c9fa150f23a79e708.webp?t=1793689579 width=1560 height=916 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE GREEK MYTHOLOGY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face creatures, monsters, and legendary figures drawn from the myths of ancient Greece as you fight your way toward the realm of the gods.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy presents a new challenge and puts the strategy you have built throughout your Odyssey to the test.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create synergies. Break the rules. Complete your Odyssey.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVOTHEON<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The gods have granted you their power. Now discover how far you can take it.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devotheon is a strategy roguelite inspired by Greek mythology, where every Odyssey begins with clear rules… and ends when you find a way to break them.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate the board, chain together powerful combos, and build ever-stronger strategies by combining <strong>spells, relics, and blessings<\/strong>. What starts as a simple choice can trigger a cascading reaction capable of completely transforming the battle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras\/3fe0e53923adf1e1acfd6a6f90c7ab5c.avif?t=1793689579\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras_big\/3fe0e53923adf1e1acfd6a6f90c7ab5c.avif?t=1793689579 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE IMPOSSIBLE COMBINATIONS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Odyssey forces you to adapt to what you find.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine effects, reshape the board, and uncover unexpected interactions between your abilities. The better your choices fit together, the further you can push each combo — and the more spectacular the chain reactions you can unleash.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW WAYS TO PLAY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your options as you progress and discover new tools for building your strategies:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 unlockable deities<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>58 spells<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>85 relics<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>46 blessings<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new content, experiment with its interactions, and discover increasingly powerful combinations. Changing deities does not just mean changing characters — it means rethinking your strategy, prioritizing different synergies, and finding new ways to master the board.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras\/ab0187ad5aad76604315f7bf5bca2697.avif?t=1793689579\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras_big\/ab0187ad5aad76604315f7bf5bca2697.avif?t=1793689579 width=1560 height=876 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CHALLENGE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devotheon features <strong>3 difficulty levels<\/strong>, allowing you to tailor the experience to your preferred style of play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the systems at your own pace, or push your strategies to the limit by taking on increasingly demanding challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras\/e04505f38b642d6c9fa150f23a79e708.avif?t=1793689579\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/extras_big\/e04505f38b642d6c9fa150f23a79e708.webp?t=1793689579 width=1560 height=916 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE GREEK MYTHOLOGY<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face creatures, monsters, and legendary figures drawn from the myths of ancient Greece as you fight your way toward the realm of the gods.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy presents a new challenge and puts the strategy you have built throughout your Odyssey to the test.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create synergies. Break the rules. Complete your Odyssey.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Build absurdly powerful combos in this strategy roguelite inspired by Greek mythology. Combine spells, blessings, and relics, reshape the board to your advantage, and break the rules to turn every Odyssey into a devastating chain of synergies.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/755965f41158595d33d02c47436fb82e14876bf9\/header.jpg?t=1793689579","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/81bdd6296791ca04083a3b44161ac19796123c66\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793689579","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5307290\/81bdd6296791ca04083a3b44161ac19796123c66\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793689579","website":"https:\/\/www.devotheon.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-6500 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 \/ AMD Radeon RX 460 (2 GB VRAM, OpenGL 3.3)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Effects quality set to Low, 1080p.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-9400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 \/ AMD Radeon RX 570 (4 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Addi